      "created_at": "2017-03-05T18:55:37.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>This game is easy. I will start the first line of a story, and the next poster will continue it with another line. Then the next adds a line, etc.</p>\n<p>To make this more interesting, your line must include the name of SotM card. Before someobe can post the next line of the story, they need to first state what deck the card comes from. Easy!</p>\n<p>Ok, I’ll start:</p>\n<p>Things were getting tense, since communications went out due to the recent solar flare.</p>",
