      "created_at": "2017-04-02T19:47:55.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Wraith <em>and </em>Southwest Sentinels</p><p>Character cards don't count, right?</p><p>Setback saw a glint of light off of a piece of metal and suddenly found himself free from the cable, and he could tell by the sigh his rescuer gave, a mix of confusion, disappointment, and the god-love-him attitude everyone has about Setback that his newfound freedom had been courtesy of his friendly neighborhood Wraith. \"It's so great how us heroes work in such good harmony!\" he thought, right before he noticed Citizen of the Sun and Christopher's Paladin lookalike falling from the rooftop above him.</p>",
